ed at Vidhana Soudha.","ids":[63884],"class":"established","sources":[1,2,3]}],[{"text":"\"Hazrat Ali uploaded an edited video to Instagram,\" investigators said.","ids":[63892],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"\"Hazrat Ali allegedly created and shared an AI-generated video depicting a bomb blast at Vidhana Soudha,\" and is a 25-year-old native of Bihar’s Araria district who worked in pipe-related jobs in Bengaluru, police said.","ids":[63882,63883],"class":"partial","sources":[1,3]}],[{"text":"Bengaluru Police are investigating the circumstances of the video's creation and the motive behind it.","ids":[63897,63898],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"They are questioning Hazrat Ali to determine his motive and whether others were involved in creating it.","ids":[63901,63902],"class":"single","sources":[1]}]],"section_keys":["news","happened","happened","happened","happened","say","say","next"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://panchjanya.com/2026/10/22/496465/bharat/karnataka/fact-check-hazrat-ali-circulated-a-fake-ai-video-of-an-explosion-at-the-karnataka-vidhana-soudha-what-is-the-truth/","outlet":"Panchjanya","title":"Fact Check: कर्नाटक विधानसौधा में विस्फोट का फर्जी वीडियो हजरत अली ने किया वायरल, क्या है सच्चाई?","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://hindi.news18.com/news/nation/bengaluru-man-arrested-for-ai-generated-vidhana-soudha-bomb-blast-video-10927751.html","outlet":"News18 Hindi","title":"अरे! विधानसभा पर बम धमाका हो गया? वीडियो वायरल होते ही पुलिस ने खोज निकाला मास्टरमाइंड","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":3,"url":"https://gulfnews.com/world/asia/india/viral-ai-video-shows-bengalurus-vidhana-soudha-blown-up-man-arrested-1.500719430","outlet":"Gulf News","title":"Viral AI video shows Bengaluru’s Vidhana Soudha blown up; man arrested","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":4,"url":"https://www.aajtak.in/karnataka/story/bengaluru-man-arrested-for-uploading-ai-bomb-blast-video-of-